    {
      "id": "claim_166d44109dc64e20a1450d551ccf70ef",
      "statement": "The Terms of Service and Privacy Policy are static HTML in `public/`, not app routes, so a blocked user with no session can still read them; each carries a `Version 2026-07-01` line that must be kept in step with `TOS_VERSION`/`PP_VERSION` by hand.",
