    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c70094dc2810454991b63a1b1dcb5299",
      "statement": "`RhAuthService.acceptConsents()` PATCHes the acceptance, then renews the token via `GET /token?renew=true` and reloads the user document; the renewal is required because a JWT is a snapshot and without a fresh one the Guards rule keeps blocking the user for the life of the token they hold.",
